  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "<p>Core-formed, black balsamarium. The vessel is decorated with a raised, comb pattern. The condition is good with a few abrasions. This small vessel may be identified as a receptacle for kohl, a black powder used as an eye cosmetic.</p>"
    ]
